## Interface: 11509, 20506, 16001, 120105
## Title: ZacUI |cff33ff99Options|r
## Notes: ZacUI's settings window and its pages. Loads by itself the first time you open the settings (/zui).
## Author: Zac
## Version: 3.0.21
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ZacUI\Media\addonIcon
## X-Category: Interface Enhancements
## Dependencies: Zacui
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## X-ZacUI-Part: Options

# Part of ZacUI. The settings window, its search, its preview strip and
# every settings page, lifted out of the main addon and its parts
# (2026-11-13) so none of it is read at login or on a reload: the game
# loads this folder the first time the settings are asked for
# (ZacUI's UI\Config\Config_Base.lua, ns.LoadOptions). The files share
# ZacUI's namespace (_G.ZacUI, published by Core_Boot) and its saved
# variables; nothing is saved here.
#
# A part's pages sit in a folder of its name and stop at their first
# lines when that part is not loaded. Load order inside each folder is the
# order the files had in their own TOC; the folders follow the order the
# game loads the parts in.

# Marks the settings as loaded (ns.optionsLoaded). First.
Options.lua

# ---------- ZacUI: the window, the search, the preview strip, the core pages ----------
Core\Config_Search.lua
Core\Config_SearchData.lua
Core\Config_SearchBox.lua
Core\Config_Preview.lua
Core\Config_Window.lua
Core\Config_PagesMain.lua
Core\Config_PagesStyle.lua
Core\Config_PagesMotion.lua
Core\Config_PagesMinimap.lua
Core\Config_PagesFlavor.lua
Core\Config_AceRender.lua
Core\Config_Profiles.lua
Core\Config_PreviewDrag.lua
Core\Config_EditLinks.lua
Core\Config_AuraFilter.lua

